    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72784.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 2,
    "turn_text": "Through a spokesperson, Senator Stabenow suggested she was willing to work on a viable path forward. Can you interpret what a viable path forward is?",
