  {
    "episode_id": 72784,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72784.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "In conversations with those who have been involved, they said there's two primary goals. Number one, providing the information that consumers want and need to know. And at the same time, not stigmatizing a technology. And some of fear that if you come up with any mandatory particular set of labeling standards, then you stigmatize that product that it's different than the rest.",
