      },
      {
        "text": "The distinction between voluntary and mandatory labeling has significant social consequences.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "People trust the judgment of those directly involved in discussions about technology.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
