  {
    "episode_id": 72784,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72784.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 25,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, and I'm all for that. I mean, I think it could be really, really good for us to spend in one year and use the other year to oversight. I mean, we've got almost a $4 trillion annual budget, and we spend very little time actually figuring out whether those programs are effective and efficient and useful ought to be continued. And I think that doing",
